{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.char": "[sine]海潮已至，我来此改写这座高塔的既定结局。[/sine]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.ancient": "改写？连海浪都会被高塔的秩序吞没。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.char": "[jitter]那就试试看，我的咒法早已算准了结局。[/jitter]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0r.char": "[sine]你的秩序一成不变，该由我来改写这一局了。[/sine]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1r.ancient": "不知收敛的旅者……那就迎战吧。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-attack": "出招吧，看看谁的术法更胜一筹！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "海岸的术士又回来了？你的牌堆里还藏着多少秘术？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-1r.char": "[sine]只要手牌未空，变幻便永不停止。[/sine]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-2r.ancient": "那就让我看清你的底牌吧。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0r.ancient": "你真以为那些附魔能撼动高塔的基石？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1r.char": "[jitter]不必猜测，下一张牌就是答案。[/jitter]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2r.ancient": "[jitter][red]够了！[/red][/jitter]",

  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.ancient": "哟！浑身带着海风味儿的术士！来看看我这堆宝贝里有没有合你手腕的玩意儿？",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.char": "[sine]只要能助我施法，什么秘宝我都有兴趣。[/sine]",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.ancient": "哈哈！说话真讲究！随便挑吧，全给你优惠价！",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "又见面了，海边来的术士！挑一件带走吧！",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.ancient": "我在破烂堆里翻出了一块会发光的海蓝色护符，准是你的同行留下的！",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.next": "回应",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.char": "[sine]那确实像是海岸学派的印记，借我一用。[/sine]",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2.ancient": "拿去拿去！在术士手里才不算蒙尘嘛！",

  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.ancient": "[sine]……潮汐的旅人……你懂得变化之道……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.char": "[sine]一切牌面皆可改写，唯独我的航向不会动摇。[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.ancient": "[sine]……那就去改写[red][jitter]建造者[/jitter][/red]的宿命吧……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]……海风再度将你送回……去吧……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.ancient": "[sine]……连诅咒都能成为你的筹码吗……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.char": "[sine]厄运也是牌库的一部分。我会将它化作力量。[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2.ancient": "[sine]……多么精妙的术法……继续前行吧……[/sine]",

  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.ancient": "啊，那身普鲁士蓝的长袍真是别致！让我为你点缀一份祝福吧。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "走近",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.char": "[sine]术士从不拒绝华丽的助力，多谢款待。[/sine]",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.ancient": "太迷人了！祝你的每一次施法都耀眼夺目！",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "优雅的术士又来了！请收下这份赠礼。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.ancient": "你指尖的附魔究竟是幻术，还是真实？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.next": "回答",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.char": "[sine]若能击倒敌人，幻术与真实又有何分别？[/sine]",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2.ancient": "说得太妙了！去尽情施展你的魅力吧！",

  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.ancient": "蓝色！闪光！卡面在变化！！你在施展什么秘术呀！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "回应",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.char": "[sine]只是些微不足道的术法。若你喜欢，请便。[/sine]",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.ancient": "好厉害！！我也送你亮晶晶的秘宝！！拿好拿好！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "会变牌的术士朋友回来啦！给你新的好东西！",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.ancient": "那些海风的坏牌一直在掉！不疼吗不疼吗！？",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.next": "回答",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.char": "[sine]一点海风的刺痛罢了，它换来的是更强的魔力。[/sine]",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2.ancient": "不懂！！但看起来好强！！",

  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]潮音与低语……你带来了大海的气息……收下这份馈赠吧……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.char": "[sine]潮水会记得每一份恩惠，谢谢你。[/sine]",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]去吧……愿海潮与你同行……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]海岸的旅者再度归来……再歇息片刻吧……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]你不断抹去旧牌的印记，又刻上新的……不会疲惫吗……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.next": "回应",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.char": "[sine]就像浪潮冲刷沙滩，每次退去都是为了更好的新生。[/sine]",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]……确实如此……[/thinky_dots]",

  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.ancient": "[b]咒牌！？附魔！？真正的好汉怎么不用大斧头！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "回答",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.char": "[jitter]锋利附在牌上，同样能一击劈开重甲。[/jitter]",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.ancient": "[b]咒牌能劈开重甲！？有意思！！算我认你！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "[b]还是那副牌！！拿件真正趁手的兵器吧！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.ancient": "[b]术士，别躲在护盾后面，来战！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.next": "回绝",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.char": "[sine]阵势还没布好之前，我不会陪你硬碰硬。[/sine]",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2.ancient": "[b]那就现在砸碎你的阵势！！[/b]",

  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.ancient": "靠近点，小术士。你身上冷冰冰的海水味，可挡不住这团[jitter][b]暖火[/b][/jitter]哦。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "什么也不说",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.char": "[sine]深海之下同样涌动着热流。别小看这抹蓝色。[/sine]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.ancient": "嘴还真硬呀。拿着这点[jitter][b]温暖[/b][/jitter]，免得被海风吹僵了。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "又回来取暖啦，小家伙？[jitter][b]别客气[/b][/jitter]。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.ancient": "你手里那些发光的咒牌，遇上我的[jitter][b]烈焰[/b][/jitter]可会化作灰烬呢。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.next": "回答",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.char": "[sine]那我就把灰烬也化作新的术法。[/sine]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2.ancient": "哈哈，真敢说呢，小可爱。",

  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.ancient": "一名与变化和厄运为伍的术士？我的[sine]契约[/sine]可比海风划算得多。",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-0.next": "对话",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.char": "[sine]术法的代价由我自己定，从不签别人的契约。[/sine]",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.0-2.ancient": "真可惜，不过你可以试试这个[sine]筹码[/sine]。",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.1-0r.ancient": "改变主意、准备落笔了吗？",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.ancient": "既然你不怕海风的诅咒，为何又拒绝我的契约？",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-0.next": "回答",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.char": "[jitter]海风是我的老朋友，[/jitter] [sine]而你只是生意人。[/sine]",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-1.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.SHOREMAGICIAN-SHORE_MAGICIAN.2-2.ancient": "[i][font_size=22][sine]狂妄的术法。[/sine][/font_size][/i]\n挑完就走吧。"
}
